{
  "packet": 8,
  "translations": [
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_024590","unique_index":0,"cn_text":"没有军队，要怎么保卫国家？尤其是中美洲，到处都有冲突隐患。","review_flag":"SEGMENTATION_REBUILT"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_024590","unique_index":1,"cn_text":"所以才需要外交。只要高举理想，成为受他国尊敬的国家，应该就能得到国际社会支持。","review_flag":"SEGMENTATION_REBUILT"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_024590","unique_index":2,"cn_text":"事实上，尼加拉瓜两次入侵时，都是由<R=美洲国家组织,OAS>调停，通过外交解决的。","review_flag":"AUX_REFERENCE_INCOMPLETE_RUBY_LOCALIZED"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_024590","unique_index":6,"cn_text":"这确实也是一种博弈。不过总有些国家会不顾一切，以武力强行压迫别人。","review_flag":"SEGMENTATION_REBUILT"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_024590","unique_index":8,"cn_text":"可我们也没指望什么都不做就得到和平，外交本身也是一场战斗。","review_flag":"SEGMENTATION_REBUILT"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_024590","unique_index":9,"cn_text":"而且我认为，必须时刻寻找灾祸的萌芽，努力将其铲除。","review_flag":"SEGMENTATION_REBUILT"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_024CA0","unique_index":1,"cn_text":"我从小就听人讲述内战的悲哀，同胞彼此争斗有多愚蠢、多悲惨……","review_flag":"SEGMENTATION_REBUILT"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_024CA0","unique_index":3,"cn_text":"于是国家转而重视教育，据说当时的口号是“每少一名士兵，就多一名教师”。","review_flag":"SEGMENTATION_REBUILT"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_024CA0","unique_index":4,"cn_text":"没错，教育很重要。就连格瓦拉也会在游击战间隙教人识字。","review_flag":"SEGMENTATION_REBUILT"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_025060","unique_index":1,"cn_text":"嗯。听说哥斯达黎加制定现行宪法时，也参考了日本宪法。","review_flag":"SEGMENTATION_REBUILT"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_0253C0","unique_index":0,"cn_text":"和平是人类关系中的非自然状态……是这么说的吗？你说在学校学过。","review_flag":"SEGMENTATION_REBUILT"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_0253C0","unique_index":3,"cn_text":"但康德的主张正是：因此，我们才必须创造和平。","review_flag":"SEGMENTATION_REBUILT"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_0253C0","unique_index":10,"cn_text":"我不想伤害无辜平民，可如果遭到别国攻击，又该怎么办？","review_flag":"SEGMENTATION_REBUILT"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_0253C0","unique_index":11,"cn_text":"要阻止侵略、压迫和不当政治统治，就需要保卫国家的力量。","review_flag":"SEGMENTATION_REBUILT"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_0253C0","unique_index":12,"cn_text":"如果所有国家都停止侵略，也不再以武力干涉他国内政，就不需要防卫力量了。","review_flag":"SEGMENTATION_REBUILT"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_0253C0","unique_index":14,"cn_text":"这个……","review_flag":"AUX_CN_EMPTY"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_0253C0","unique_index":15,"cn_text":"……抱歉。不过要保护自己和家人，也必须了解现实。","review_flag":"SEGMENTATION_REBUILT"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_025B50","unique_index":0,"cn_text":"虽说都是哥斯达黎加的森林，种类却有很多，并非全是所谓的热带雨林。","review_flag":"SEGMENTATION_REBUILT"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_025DF0","unique_index":0,"cn_text":"加勒比海沿岸低地大多是高温湿润的热带雨林，也就是多数人想象中的“丛林”。","review_flag":"SEGMENTATION_REBUILT"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_025DF0","unique_index":1,"cn_text":"密集的树木为争取阳光，在高处长出茂盛枝叶。地面附近昏暗，千万小心。","review_flag":"SEGMENTATION_REBUILT"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_026130","unique_index":1,"cn_text":"旱季期间树木会落叶，视野虽好，能藏身的地方却更少，务必小心。","review_flag":"SEGMENTATION_REBUILT"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_026710","unique_index":5,"cn_text":"它的金属蓝色翅膀非常漂亮，闪闪发光，远远就能看见。","review_flag":"SEGMENTATION_REBUILT"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_026710","unique_index":7,"cn_text":"对，这叫结构色。闪蝶鳞粉表面有细微凹凸，光线在那里发生干涉，看起来便呈蓝色。","review_flag":"SEGMENTATION_REBUILT"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_026DE0","unique_index":8,"cn_text":"准分类学家，也就是<R=分类学家,TAXONOMIST>的<R=辅助人员,PARA>。","review_flag":"RUBY_LOCALIZED"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_0273B0","unique_index":0,"cn_text":"<R=哥斯达黎加开发公司,CODESA>成立于前年。","review_flag":"RUBY_LOCALIZED"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_0273B0","unique_index":1,"cn_text":"今年Oduber总统当选以后，国家进一步加大了开发力度。","review_flag":"SEGMENTATION_REBUILT"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_0273B0","unique_index":5,"cn_text":"我怀疑<R=开发公司,CODESA>会不会是<R=CIA,LA CIA>的掩护。","review_flag":"RUBY_LOCALIZED"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_0273B0","unique_index":7,"cn_text":"<R=开发公司,CODESA>被他们当作<R=伪装,CAMOUFLAGE>……","review_flag":"RUBY_LOCALIZED"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_027800","unique_index":1,"cn_text":"名字寄托着希望这个国家永远和平的愿望，在中美洲很常见。","review_flag":"SEGMENTATION_REBUILT"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_027C30","unique_index":4,"cn_text":"说到底，V手势的V是<R=胜利,VICTORY>的V吧？从什么时候开始表示和平了？","review_flag":"SEGMENTATION_REBUILT_RUBY_LOCALIZED"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_027C30","unique_index":5,"cn_text":"我也不太清楚……似乎是从反对越南战争的运动开始。","review_flag":"SEGMENTATION_REBUILT"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_027FF0","unique_index":6,"cn_text":"住在一起就藏不住秘密，我也能感觉到自己给她们添了麻烦……","review_flag":"SEGMENTATION_REBUILT"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_027FF0","unique_index":9,"cn_text":"有些<R=私生子,BASTARD>失去母亲后会沦为流浪儿童，内战频发的国家情况更糟。","review_flag":"RUBY_LOCALIZED"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_0285D0","unique_index":0,"cn_text":"Snake，我有件事想拜托你。","review_flag":"CONTEXT_ALIGNMENT_REVIEWED"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_0285D0","unique_index":1,"cn_text":"什么事？","review_flag":"CONTEXT_ALIGNMENT_REVIEWED"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_0285D0","unique_index":2,"cn_text":"也让我帮忙做些母基地的工作吧，我想为大家出份力。","review_flag":"CONTEXT_ALIGNMENT_REVIEWED"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_0285D0","unique_index":3,"cn_text":"没问题吗？刚发生过那种事，等平静下来之前最好先休息。","review_flag":"CONTEXT_ALIGNMENT_REVIEWED_SEGMENTATION_REBUILT"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_0285D0","unique_index":4,"cn_text":"谢谢。不过我还是想用自己的方式，做些力所能及的事。","review_flag":"CONTEXT_ALIGNMENT_REVIEWED_SEGMENTATION_REBUILT"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_0285D0","unique_index":5,"cn_text":"拿枪或许不行，但我很擅长烹饪。","review_flag":"CONTEXT_ALIGNMENT_REVIEWED_AUX_REFERENCE_REJECTED"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_0285D0","unique_index":6,"cn_text":"那可真可靠。","review_flag":"CONTEXT_ALIGNMENT_REVIEWED_AUX_REFERENCE_REJECTED"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_0285D0","unique_index":7,"cn_text":"如果把我分配到食堂班，我会努力的。等熟悉以后，还想在菜单里加入哥斯达黎加菜。","review_flag":"CONTEXT_ALIGNMENT_REVIEWED_AUX_REFERENCE_INCOMPLETE"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_0285D0","unique_index":8,"cn_text":"那就拜托你了。","review_flag":"CONTEXT_ALIGNMENT_REVIEWED"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_0289C0","unique_index":2,"cn_text":"碧蓝大海、洁白沙滩、翠绿椰树……南国风情十足，简直是人间天堂。","review_flag":"SEGMENTATION_REBUILT"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_0289C0","unique_index":5,"cn_text":"这里也是动物们的乐园。","review_flag":"SEGMENTATION_REBUILT"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_029020","unique_index":0,"cn_text":"雇佣兵用来运入物资的基地，坐落在海边高地。","review_flag":"CONTEXT_ALIGNMENT_REVIEWED"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_029020","unique_index":1,"cn_text":"他们擅自把那里叫作“Puerto del Alba”，意思是“曙光之港”。","review_flag":"CONTEXT_ALIGNMENT_REVIEWED"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_029020","unique_index":2,"cn_text":"从基地能将四周一览无余。我们试着不被发现地潜入……可还是被哨兵看见，然后……","review_flag":"CONTEXT_ALIGNMENT_REVIEWED_SEGMENTATION_REBUILT"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_029020","unique_index":3,"cn_text":"怎么了？","review_flag":"CONTEXT_ALIGNMENT_REVIEWED"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_029020","unique_index":4,"cn_text":"……对不起，详情去问Gálvez教授好吗？","review_flag":"CONTEXT_ALIGNMENT_REVIEWED"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_029020","unique_index":5,"cn_text":"……明白了，不必强迫自己回想。","review_flag":"CONTEXT_ALIGNMENT_REVIEWED"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_029020","unique_index":6,"cn_text":"对不起……我实在……","review_flag":"CONTEXT_ALIGNMENT_REVIEWED"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_029020","unique_index":7,"cn_text":"我不会让你的努力白费，你已经做得很好了。","review_flag":"CONTEXT_ALIGNMENT_REVIEWED"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_029400","unique_index":0,"cn_text":"这里和Bosque del Alba一样也是热带雨林，是高温湿润的森林地带。El Cenegal意为“泥”。","review_flag":"SEGMENTATION_REBUILT"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_0296E0","unique_index":3,"cn_text":"这附近大概没有其他地方能过河了。","review_flag":"AUX_REFERENCE_REJECTED_SEGMENTATION_REBUILT"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_029A10","unique_index":1,"cn_text":"沼泽吗？脚下是<R=泥,EL CENEGAL>，得留意脚步声。","review_flag":"RUBY_LOCALIZED"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_029C30","unique_index":5,"cn_text":"河流在这一带也是重要运输路线，水流平缓，沿海还有许多运河。","review_flag":"SEGMENTATION_REBUILT"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_02A0B0","unique_index":0,"cn_text":"哥斯达黎加加勒比海沿岸盛产香蕉，到处都有这样的<R=香蕉园,BANANAL>。","review_flag":"AUX_REFERENCE_INCOMPLETE_RUBY_LOCALIZED"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_02A0B0","unique_index":2,"cn_text":"真是<R=黄金果实,FRUTA DE ORO>。","review_flag":"RUBY_LOCALIZED"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_02A4F0","unique_index":4,"cn_text":"食用香蕉不会结籽，所以要分出新芽培育，再把它们一株株种进田里……","review_flag":"JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_02A4F0","unique_index":7,"cn_text":"如今栽培的是另一个香蕉品种，据说可以抵抗巴拿马病。","review_flag":"SEGMENTATION_REBUILT"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_02A960","unique_index":1,"cn_text":"原来如此，所以才叫“<R=熔岩之路,CAMINO DE LAVA>”。","review_flag":"RUBY_LOCALIZED"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_02AF50","unique_index":4,"cn_text":"竟占领这样的村庄当战俘营……不可原谅。无论是<R=CIA,LA CIA>，还是受<R=CIA,LA CIA>雇佣的人！","review_flag":"AUX_REFERENCE_INCOMPLETE_RUBY_LOCALIZED"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_02AF50","unique_index":5,"cn_text":"村民原本应该过着和平生活，他们有什么权力践踏这一切！？","review_flag":"SEGMENTATION_REBUILT"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_02B420","unique_index":0,"cn_text":"这座咖啡工厂也被<R=CIA,LA CIA>占领了……甚至变成了毒品工厂。","review_flag":"RUBY_LOCALIZED"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_02B420","unique_index":4,"cn_text":"到时候，我也想用这里产的咖啡冲给Snake喝。","review_flag":"SEGMENTATION_REBUILT"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_02B420","unique_index":7,"cn_text":"没什么……只是想起以前认识的一个讨厌咖啡的英国人。他总说别喝那种泥水，去喝红茶。","review_flag":"SEGMENTATION_REBUILT"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_02B930","unique_index":0,"cn_text":"哥斯达黎加铁路施工困难不断，听说造成大量伤亡，工程也曾中断。","review_flag":"SEGMENTATION_REBUILT"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_02B930","unique_index":3,"cn_text":"<R=绞刑台,EL CADALSO>吗？品位可不怎么样。不过那种情况下，建设资金竟然还能撑得下去。","review_flag":"SEGMENTATION_REBUILT_RUBY_LOCALIZED"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_02B930","unique_index":5,"cn_text":"是吃香蕉补充体力，努力施工吗？香蕉的营养价值确实……","review_flag":"SEGMENTATION_REBUILT"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_02BEE0","unique_index":4,"cn_text":"通常会在谷底修建水库，但这里地势太险峻，大概办不到。","review_flag":"AUX_REFERENCE_REJECTED_SEGMENTATION_REBUILT"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_02C230","unique_index":0,"cn_text":"从那一带应该能将Irazú山系尽收眼底。海拔高，长不出大树，视野想必很好。","review_flag":"CONTEXT_ALIGNMENT_REVIEWED_SEGMENTATION_REBUILT"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_02C230","unique_index":1,"cn_text":"看来很难找到藏身之处。","review_flag":"CONTEXT_ALIGNMENT_REVIEWED"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_02C230","unique_index":2,"cn_text":"对Snake来说，风景根本无所谓吧。","review_flag":"CONTEXT_ALIGNMENT_REVIEWED"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_02C230","unique_index":3,"cn_text":"没被敌人包围时就不一定了。","review_flag":"CONTEXT_ALIGNMENT_REVIEWED"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_02C230","unique_index":4,"cn_text":"真希望你能在和平时看看，一定会很感动。","review_flag":"CONTEXT_ALIGNMENT_REVIEWED_AUX_REFERENCE_INCOMPLETE"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_02C230","unique_index":5,"cn_text":"那就留到任务成功以后再享受吧，可以吗？","review_flag":"CONTEXT_ALIGNMENT_REVIEWED"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_02C230","unique_index":6,"cn_text":"谢谢你，Snake。","review_flag":"CONTEXT_ALIGNMENT_REVIEWED"}
  ]
}
